WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.000 line:73%
Umuulan. May silbi
pa ba ang solar mo?

c02
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:06.120 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:08.560 line:73%
Oo, pero mas
mahina ang output.

c04
00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:12.600 line:73%
Kapag maulap, nababawasan
ang liwanag sa panels.

c05
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:16.390 line:73%
Kaya bumababa ang output,
minsan malaki ang bawas.

c06
00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:20.160 line:73%
Pero madalas hindi zero, dahil
may diffuse light pa rin.

c07
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:25.970 line:73%
Ang tamang tingin: kWh sa
buong buwan, hindi isang araw.

cz1
00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:32.220 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:35.030 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
